OL,3,GNEWSAStudents react to GCSE results as
OL,4,Aregional gap widens in England
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of thousands of students have
OL,7,Fopened their GCSE, BTec and Cambridge
OL,8,FNationals results in England, Wales and
OL,9,FNorthern Ireland
OL,11,FThe overall pass rate has fallen
OL,12,Fslightly for the fifth year in a row -
OL,13,Fbut top grades have edged up across all
OL,14,Fthree nations, as the regional gap in
OL,15,FEngland has widened
OL,17,FQuadruplets Rose, Ellen, Layla and Eric
OL,18,Fhappily collected their GCSE results
OL,19,Ftogether, but are also pleased for a
OL,20,F"break" from each other as they go to
OL,21,Fseparate colleges
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,347,340,200,160,0,100
