OL,3,GNEWSAStudents react to GCSE results as
OL,4,Aregional gap widens in England
OL,5,
OL,6,FNasser, who's fled the war in Sudan,
OL,7,Fsays passing his maths and English
OL,8,FGCSEs is one of his "proudest moments",
OL,9,Fwhile Isla says she's "smashed" her
OL,10,Fresults
OL,12,FNot everyone getting their results is a
OL,13,Fteenager - with 56-year-old nurse
OL,14,FJoanne passing her maths exam nearly 40
OL,15,Fyears after her last resit
OL,17,FOur team of experts have been answering
OL,18,Fyour questions - giving advice on
OL,19,Fthings like getting your paper remarked
OL,20,Fand if you don't have a plan yet
